{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f75cebb63fddd11681511344e6db28aa28bdd1b039c333b05aa90d2ef688ba80", "ja": "（アイドルと子供たちによるコンサートが始まった。\n次は子ども達の伴奏に合わせて、ジュリアが歌う番だ）", "zh": "（偶像和孩子们的演唱会开始了。接下来轮到茱莉亚配合孩子们的伴奏歌唱了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9b8a2cd22de4995369495ebda4ebe01d15895a1711341fa091a24de57ff2991b", "ja": "ジュリア、そろそろ出番だけど……\nもしかして、緊張してるのか？", "zh": "茱莉亚，差不多该你上场了……\n难道说，你紧张了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "9cfbc32db1583426de3d975999bad831e557f3b53a544d9499efeae92a1cdf79", "ja": "ああ、あんたか。そうだな……今回は柄にもなく、ね。\nいつもなら、こうまでならないんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，是你啊。是啊……这次有点不像我了。\n平时我可不会紧张成这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "575bb106eb5cbac34af1a4acbf6dec15cd07e15fdde67787d7e4aabc6fac63a9", "ja": "あたしはともかく……一緒に出演するあの子達が、さ。\n今日までみんなで練習してきたの、知ってるよな？", "zh": "我先不说……和我一起出演的那些孩子嘛。你知道我们一直练习到今天吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "85b9a0532ad3cdb87c8149638322b29441e3d0ac5b3bafa65607f37ee28c7d84", "ja": "あたしが失敗したら、あの子たちの努力が台無しに\nなるかもしれない。そう思ったら、どうしても……。", "zh": "要是我失败了，那些孩子的努力可能就全白费了。一想到这个，我就怎么都……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1006_p", "source_sha256": "32a29264f8a40c67b553afc2168363543d3bb4d79a55a93b11872571e6be9a38", "ja": "なるほど……責任を感じているんだな。", "zh": "原来如此……你感到很有责任吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "17e5661b292fbe9c33721fff7c510353c920d696555e7721c85dcbdbfb3b90a9", "ja": "当然だろ？　あたしは、あの子たちの先生なんだ。\nでも、先生がこのザマじゃ、情けないよな……。", "zh": "那是当然的吧？我可是那些孩子的老师啊。\n但当老师的搞成这副德行，也太丢人了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ecf0b244b76389617d8fae46c7f0ad1d04943a36d787686cd6256080bae282e1", "ja": "どんなベテランだって、緊張する時はするよ。\nそれに……。", "zh": "无论多么身经百战的人，也会有紧张的时候。\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1009_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "2bf6b06b4224d436f2afdbaeaf03802093fe241609c6c05a60ee1f4478476919", "ja": "ジュリアおねえちゃーん！", "zh": "茱莉亚姐姐——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "1247ed3e040e9c81c8409a49a2ca57fc035df79ea8e07ebaf4cbe586a82f38bd", "ja": "おっと……なんだ、どうした？\n人がいっぱいいるんで、緊張しちゃったのか？", "zh": "哦……怎么了，发生什么事了？\n是不是因为人太多，紧张了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1011_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "bb8f3b4dd7ab2f08b5c037c68539def6b94e7ddfaf470ad402aea205f578f9f5", "ja": "ううん。\nさっきのれんしゅう、たのしかったよね！", "zh": "没有哦。\n刚才的练习，很开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "79bbe0c870172557f68c53e6196910a15d6f3c44982154c19d6a3ebe769811ce", "ja": "練習？　ああ、リハーサルのことか。\nそうだな、楽しかったな。", "zh": "练习？啊，你说的是彩排吧。是啊，挺开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1013_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "61cfd720ec8ca56956a6e065755ebac5987f1a7b2c86f2c50d366fb646091aeb", "ja": "このあと、みんなでまたえんそうするんだよね？\nぼく、すっごくたのしみ！", "zh": "接下来还要和大家一起演奏，对吧？\n我特别期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1014_staff", "source_sha256": "66e23beebc3a6f81dae8a01ab12123aa22fcf164dbdbbf07122151adf704f965", "ja": "しゅうくん、どこー？\nそろそろ始まるから、みんなのところに来てー。", "zh": "しゅう，你在哪儿——？\n差不多要开始了，快到大家这边来——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1015_otokonoko", "source_sha256": "22d82d2f7d60dc04e8f97adbbeb6a5511e734feb7109b5ad2c46a85660d96449", "ja": "あっ、よばれちゃった！　ぼく、もどらなきゃ。\nジュリアおねえちゃん、おわったらまたあそんでね！", "zh": "啊，被叫到了！我得回去了。\n茱莉亚姐姐，结束后再陪我玩哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "6c731cdc560642a18942e5788c1ad757b081d289c1a8e1101bb5cb5ab4a04a87", "ja": "あ……！", "zh": "啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1017_se", "source_sha256": "92bb3cb780d3f16cd3bae123a5cf2fcf5774ce8c6cb4b9b38bbd9215d9c319bf", "ja": "タッタッタ……。", "zh": "哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1018_p", "source_sha256": "daf96b2859ff14a32f55d8ae862784f8cfa470e9fb52254357e224865700890a", "ja": "行っちゃったな。", "zh": "已经走了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "ac16e1900137ad41f92c931756fa3a7597b0738f4019e112289274f7313c3a1e", "ja": "ふっ……ははっ！　なんだよ、もう。\n簡単に言ってくれちゃって……。", "zh": "呼……哈哈！真是的。\n说得倒是轻巧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "1c1bb3e1bdd479493c2add66582ba2de33afb1541af153f129d755be95853a64", "ja": "そうだった……あいつらは、演奏を楽しんでるんだ。\nだったらあたしも、一緒に楽しめばいいんだな。", "zh": "对了……那帮家伙是在享受演奏的乐趣啊。\n既然这样，我也一起享受就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c974f026dcd85df54dcd06e73354a463824fb64edf1bedbd7c74b89bd4597e06", "ja": "ああ、そうだな！\n頑張れよ、ジュリアおねえちゃん。", "zh": "啊，对啊！\n加油啊，茱莉亚姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "4bcffbea7740c35aec943280348e5c2790f54c19e7f13ac9ce2c02a5ecc60924", "ja": "へ………は、はぁ！？　いきなり何言ってんだよ！\nあんたのおねえちゃんになったつもりはないっての！", "zh": "诶……哈、哈啊！？突然说什么呢！\n我可没打算当你的姐姐啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "9c7eae0ece58c1709f6496a8186f7dcb83849a68dae0a5e5cc39b605bd30f1be", "ja": "ったく、驚かせやがって……\nあんたって、ホントおかしなヤツだよな！　バカP！", "zh": "真是的，吓我一跳……  \n你这家伙，真是个奇怪的人啊！笨蛋P！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0154_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b0ac64096835b39ac359f06f4a74025f2a248d59c7f760acb9b77c99a8b01b14", "ja": "（あの子のおかげで、ジュリアも肩の力が抜けた\nみたいだ。きっと、楽しいステージになるだろう）", "zh": "（多亏了那个孩子，茱莉亚似乎也放松下来了。一定会成为一场欢乐的演出。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
